fixture cam_noborder
doc Camera review round 3: a room whose left wall and floor are the grid's own edge (no border tiles; outside a room is solid): run left into the edge, crouch-look on the bottom edge, then jump; the eased bounds reach the room's edge exactly, so the margin never has to move the view
room test/cam_noborder
spawn 400 1280
frames 200
input
  0..80 L
  81..140 D
  141 jump
end
expect
  at 141 event.jump=1
end
